- Cash position and runway: With $5.2M in cash and a 16-month runway, current plan-level net cash outflow is approximately $325K/month. This is materially higher than the standalone $45K operating burn you cited — likely driven by planned investments, seasonally high cash needs, financing costs, or one-off items.
