Quick math / reconciliation
- Cash on hand: $5.2M
- Revenue (last quarter): $2.4M → monthly average ≈ $800K, annualized ≈ $9.6M
- If net burn = $45K/month:
  - Runway = 5,200,000 / 45,000 ≈ 115.6 months → ≈ 9.6 years (≈116 months).  
  - Implied monthly operating cash outflows = revenue + net burn ≈ 800K + 45K = 845K/month.
