- Horizon Media has $5.2M in cash and generated $2.4M in revenue last quarter (avg $800K/month). Based on the current planning runway of 16 months, our implied net cash burn is approximately $325K/month. This level of monthly net outflow requires active management to preserve runway and fund planned initiatives.

