- Revenue LTM run-rate: $9.6M (Q revenue x4)
- Average monthly revenue (last quarter): $800K
- Reported net cash burn: either $45K/mo (=> runway ~116 months) OR implied $325K/mo (=> runway 16 months) — clarify definition
- Top 3 drivers of cash burn: [insert items once you confirm them]
- Immediate ask: [e.g., re-forecast, approve cost reductions, authorize fundraising prep]

