- Template B (if runway = 16 months): "At quarter-end we held $5.2M in cash and delivered $2.4M in revenue. Our planning runway is 16 months, which implies an estimated net cash burn of ~$325K/month. To preserve runway, we recommend immediate segmentation of fixed vs discretionary costs, a 12–18 month scenario plan, and preparing contingency fundraising materials in the event conservative scenarios materialize."

