- Immediate (30 days): freeze nonessential hires, pause discretionary marketing, tighten PO approvals; run cash forecast weekly.
- Near term (60–90 days): accelerate collections (shorten DSO), renegotiate vendor payment terms, postpone noncritical capex.
- Mid term: build 3 scenarios (base, downside, upside) and finalize financing plan if runway <12 months under downside.
