Option B (conservative case): "Horizon Media holds $5.2M in cash and current operations imply a net burn of approximately $325K/month, providing ~16 months of runway. Immediate actions: finalize a 3-scenario cash plan, limit discretionary spend, and prepare contingency financing to preserve optionality."

