- Scenario planning: Build three scenarios (Base: current burn; Downside: +20% burn or -15% revenue; Upside: revenue acceleration / cost optimization). Show runway under each.
- Actions & asks: prioritize high-ROI revenue initiatives, tighten discretionary spend, delay non-essential hires, and prepare a fundraising plan (term sheet targets, timing, amount to extend runway to 24–36 months).
