Key takeaways and interpretation
- Cash runway is excellent — multi-year optionality to invest in growth, product, or M&A without urgent fundraising.
- We should confirm cash collection timing and one-off uses of cash (capex, debt service, taxes) to ensure runway analysis is net of all expected cash outflows.
- Recommended action: maintain disciplined forecasting, prioritize high-ROI investments, and build a 12–24 month scenario plan for potential revenue downside (e.g., -20% or -40%) and upside.
