- Medium-term (3–9 months): model scenarios and prepare a fundraising plan (if needed) to start 6–9 months before runway exhaustion; target extending runway to 24 months.
- Governance: provide monthly cash-variance reporting to the exec team and board, with clear triggers for fundraising or cost interventions.
