- Monthly cash balance (12–18 months) under Base / Downside / Upside scenarios.
- Net burn trend chart (last 6 quarters) showing gross burn, revenue, and net burn.
- Bridge explaining change in cash balance since last quarter (major items: hires, marketing, customer receipts, one-offs).
- KPI table: runway, revenue run-rate, gross margin, DSO, committed FTE cost.
- Action plan + timing (freeze hires, fundraising timeline, contingency cuts list).

